---
layout: base.njk
title: Roofers in Doncaster
description: Roof Doctor provides roof repairs and complete new roofs in Doncaster and across South Yorkshire, with honest advice, fair prices, and tidy workmanship.
---
<section class="border-b border-slate-900/10 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,#f8f5ef_0%,#f8f5ef_72%,#e7e5e4_72%,#e7e5e4_100%)]">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-12 px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_0.85fr] lg:px-8 lg:py-20">
    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-amber-700">Local Doncaster roofers</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-5xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-6xl">Roofing work done properly, from repairs to complete new roofs.</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">{{ site.tagline }}. We work across Doncaster and South Yorkshire for homeowners and businesses who want straightforward advice, fair prices, and workmanship that lasts.</p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row">
        <a href="/contact/" class="inline-flex justify-center bg-amber-500 px-6 py-4 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-950 motion-safe:transition hover:bg-amber-400 motion-reduce:transition-none">Request a quote</a>
        <a href="/services/" class="inline-flex justify-center border border-slate-900 px-6 py-4 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-950 motion-safe:transition hover:bg-slate-900 hover:text-white motion-reduce:transition-none">View services</a>
      </div>
      <dl class="mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="border-l-4 border-amber-500 pl-4">
          <dt class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500">Work covered</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-base font-semibold text-slate-950">Repairs and new roofs</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-4 border-amber-500 pl-4">
          <dt class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500">Customers</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-base font-semibold text-slate-950">Homes and businesses</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-4 border-amber-500 pl-4">
          <dt class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500">Coverage</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-base font-semibold text-slate-950">Doncaster and South Yorkshire</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
    <div class="self-end">
      <div class="overflow-hidden border border-slate-900 bg-slate-900 text-white shadow-[18px_18px_0_0_#f59e0b]">
        <div class="aspect-[4/5] bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top,_#475569_0,_#1e293b_48%,_#0f172a_100%)] p-6">
          <div class="flex h-full flex-col justify-between border border-white/20 p-6">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 320 240" class="w-full" role="img" aria-label="Roofline illustration">
              <path d="M20 160 160 55l140 105" fill="none" stroke="#fbbf24" stroke-width="12" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter"/>
              <path d="M64 160h192" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="square"/>
              <path d="M112 160V108h96v52" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="square"/>
              <path d="M144 160v-28h32v28" fill="none" stroke="#fbbf24" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="square"/>
            </svg>
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-amber-300">Why people call us</p>
              <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-200">
                {% for point in site.trustPoints %}
                  <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2 h-2.5 w-2.5 shrink-0 bg-amber-400"></span><span>{{ point }}</span></li>
                {% endfor %}
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="border-b border-slate-900/10 bg-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] lg:items-start">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-amber-700">The right fit for practical roofing work</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">A local team for customers who care about the standard of the job.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid gap-6 text-base leading-7 text-slate-700 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <p>Most visitors are trying to work out whether they have found a trustworthy roofer who actually covers their area and can take on the type of job they need. That means clear information matters more than flashy sales talk.</p>
        <p>Roofing decisions can be urgent when there is a leak, but they are also high-value and trust-led. People want to know who will turn up, how they work, whether the quote will be straightforward, and whether the place will be left tidy afterwards.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-stone-100">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-amber-700">Services</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">Roofing help for repairs, replacements, homes, and businesses.</h2>
      </div>
      <a href="/services/" class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-950 underline decoration-amber-500 decoration-2 underline-offset-4">See all services</a>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-px border border-slate-900 bg-slate-900 md:grid-cols-2">
      {% for service in site.serviceHighlights %}
        <article class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950">{{ service.title }}</h3>
          <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-700">{{ service.summary }}</p>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="border-y border-slate-900/10 bg-white">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr] lg:px-8">
    <article>
      <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-amber-700">Trust</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950">What matters in this trade</h2>
      <ul class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-700">
        <li class="border-l-4 border-slate-900 pl-4">Straight answers about the condition of the roof and the work it needs.</li>
        <li class="border-l-4 border-slate-900 pl-4">A team that respects the property and leaves the site clean and tidy.</li>
        <li class="border-l-4 border-slate-900 pl-4">Confidence built through repeat custom and recommendations rather than hard selling.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
    <article>
      <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-amber-700">Coverage</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950">Serving homeowners and businesses across the local area</h2>
      <p class="mt-6 text-base leading-7 text-slate-700">Roof Doctor works across Doncaster and South Yorkshire. Whether you need help at home or for a business property, the aim is the same: do the job properly, keep communication clear, and avoid surprises.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-stone-200">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-amber-700">How we work</p>
    <h2 class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">A practical process built around honest advice and solid workmanship.</h2>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-4">
      {% for item in site.process %}
        <article class="border border-slate-900 bg-white p-6">
          <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-amber-700">{{ item.step }}</p>
          <h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-bold text-slate-950">{{ item.title }}</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-700">{{ item.summary }}</p>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set ctaTitle = "Tell us what you need and we will come back with clear advice." %}
{% set ctaCopy = "If you need a roofing repair priced or you want to discuss a complete new roof, send an enquiry and we will arrange the next step without any pushy sales talk." %}
{% include "partials/contact-cta.njk" %}
